  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><p class=\"p1\">• About our brand and products:</p><p class=\"p1\">JOBY is a globally recognized brand in mobile content creation and camera accessories, best known for the iconic GorillaPod. We design flexible, creator-first tools that empower photographers, filmmakers, and content creators to shoot anywhere. Our product lineup includes tripods, mounts, lighting solutions, microphones, and creator gear built for portability, durability, and real-world shooting scenarios.</p><p class=\"p2\"><br></p><p class=\"p1\">• What makes us different:</p><p class=\"p1\">Creator-first design built on real shooting needs, category leadership with GorillaPod defining the flexible tripod space, strong global brand recognition, a focus on practical innovation over gimmicks, and a bold, recognizable visual identity.</p><p class=\"p2\"><br></p><p class=\"p1\">• How affiliates can earn:</p><p class=\"p1\">Affiliates earn competitive commissions on all qualified sales, with opportunities for higher tiers based on performance. We offer bonus incentives during product launches and seasonal campaigns, along with exclusive discount codes and promotions to help drive conversions.</p><p class=\"p2\"><br></p><p class=\"p1\">• How to promote us:</p><p class=\"p1\">Affiliates can promote JOBY through product reviews, YouTube and TikTok content, “what’s in my bag” setups, tutorials for photography and videography, comparison videos, and social media posts showcasing real-world usage. We provide creatives, product assets, and campaign materials to support content creation.</p><p class=\"p2\"><br></p><p class=\"p1\">• Other information:</p><p class=\"p1\">We offer global shipping, strong conversion rates driven by brand recognition, frequent product launches to keep content fresh, and dedicated affiliate support. JOBY is especially well suited for creators in photography, videography, travel, and lifestyle niches.</p></div>",
